      "writtenOn": "2024-08-27T17:22:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Greg, we have a requirement to allocate memory which is not initialized with Zero (requirement is for both uncached and cached memory) which are shared with DSP.\n\nDma-buf framework supports only initialized memory with Cached and uncached dma-buf heaps.\n\nSo we want to use ARM PMEM based API\u0027s for cache operations on memremap\u0027ed buffers. Hence whitelisting of these symbols are requested.\n\nThanks - Venkat",
      "parentUuid": "8d239664_124efd9f",
